## Document organization currently (08/17/25) ##
BookPersistenceManager - holds the current bookshelf that is shown to the user
BookshelfModel - holds shelves that a given bookshelf will have 
ShelfModel - holds a list of books that a specific shelf will hold; keeps a list of those books that are saved in a given shelf
BookModel - holds individual, distinct book information (Title, ISBN, Cover, PageCount)
